{"unit_id": "tag:04ND:statement", "translation": "芽（germs）的态射（morphisms）的性质\n<MATHSEG_0001>是平坦（flat）的<MATHSEG_0002>\n是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）源与目标上局部（local on the source-and-target）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "源与目标上局部"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽", "context": "概形芽的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所研究的芽态射。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "局部环之间的平坦性。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "局部性所用拓扑。"}, {"source_term": "local on the source-and-target", "target_term": "源与目标上局部", "context": "芽态射性质的源与目标局部性。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04ND:proof", "translation": "给定定义<REF_0001>中的一个图（diagram），我们得到如下局部环（local rings）的局部（local）同态（homomorphisms）的图（diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n注意，垂直箭头（vertical arrows）是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）环映射（ring maps）的局部化（localizations），特别地，它们是本质上（essentially）有限表示（finite presentation）的、平坦（flat）的且非分歧（unramified）的（见代数（Algebra），第<REF_0002>节）。特别地，这些垂直映射（vertical maps）是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的，见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0003>。现在，若上方水平箭头（upper horizontal arrow）是平坦（flat）的，则应用代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0004>，取<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>，可知下方水平箭头（lower horizontal arrow）是平坦（flat）的。若下方水平箭头（lower horizontal arrow）是平坦（flat）的，则环映射（ring map）\n<MATH_0005>\n由代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0005>可知是平坦（flat）的。而环映射（ring map）\n<MATH_0006>\n是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）环（ring）扩张（extensions）之间一个映射（map）的局部化（localization），这些扩张是<MATH_0007>的扩张，因此由代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0006>可知它是平坦（flat）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "localizations", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "essentially", "target_term": "本质上"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "vertical maps", "target_term": "垂直映射"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "upper horizontal arrow", "target_term": "上方水平箭头"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "lower horizontal arrow", "target_term": "下方水平箭头"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "lower horizontal arrow", "target_term": "下方水平箭头"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图", "context": "定义中的图和局部环图。"}, {"source_term": "local rings", "target_term": "局部环", "context": "芽在指定点的局部环。"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "局部同态的限定。"}, {"source_term": "homomorphisms", "target_term": "同态", "context": "局部环之间的同态。"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头", "context": "交换图的垂直箭头。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "环映射和环扩张的平展性。"}, {"source_term": "ring maps", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "被局部化的环映射。"}, {"source_term": "localizations", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "垂直箭头的描述。"}, {"source_term": "essentially", "target_term": "本质上", "context": "本质上有限表示的限定。"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示", "context": "垂直环映射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "水平箭头及环映射的平坦性。"}, {"source_term": "unramified", "target_term": "非分歧", "context": "垂直环映射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "vertical maps", "target_term": "垂直映射", "context": "图中的垂直映射。"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "局部平坦映射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "upper horizontal arrow", "target_term": "上方水平箭头", "context": "图的上方水平箭头。"}, {"source_term": "lower horizontal arrow", "target_term": "下方水平箭头", "context": "图的下方水平箭头。"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "两次考察的环映射。"}, {"source_term": "ring", "target_term": "环", "context": "平展环扩张的对象。"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "给定局部环的环扩张。"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射", "context": "平展环扩张之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "localization", "target_term": "局部化", "context": "最后环映射的描述。"}], "notes": []}
